<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Iwo Jima Goes to Mozambique, 2024</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;In the early 2020s, the United States began using a new form of rapid response force.&amp;nbsp; Centered around a "Lightning Carrier," and employing a destroyer and a submarine as escorts for its high value command vessel, and two light combatants as multi-mission scouts,&amp;nbsp;an Expeditionary Task Force is capable of handling short and medium duration&amp;nbsp;deployments to address low intensity conflicts.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes Mozambique is experiencing civil unrest and that RENAMO, one of the combatants during that country's long civil war, has once again become active.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
